<title>UK: Bank Handlowy adds $50 mln to three-year bond.</title>
<headline>Bank Handlowy adds $50 mln to three-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was increased to</p>
<p>$200 million from $150 million, lead manager J.P. Morgan said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   HANDLOWY FINANCE BV</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  BANK HANDLOWY</p>
<p> AMT  * $200 MLN	COUPON     7.125     MATURITY  * 15.MAY.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.953    PAY DATE  L-14.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.25	REOFFER    99.953    SPREAD	+60 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	BAA3	LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS US/UK/PL</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  POLAND    TAX PROVS   GROSS UP</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.125     SELL CONC  0.125     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND U.S. TREASURY NOTES</p>
<p> NOTES    * ORIGINAL LAUNCHED ON APRIL 30. MATURITY DATE</p>
<p>AMMENDED TO</p>
<p>		15.MAY.00 FROM 14.MAY.00. LONG LAST COUPON</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
